lates the Deltas for the each altitude reading,\r\nand the Astronomical Position (for two or more sights).\r\n\r\nIf you have a marine sextant at hand, you can correct the phone readings with it and get some real celnav work done. \r\n\r\nNice for celestial navigation training, even without a marine sextant.\r\n\r\nFor more information check:\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tecepe.com.br%2Fnav%2FCamSextant%2FTutorial&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw04ZVP_DFmy1KkuRcxUQNmV\">CamSextant Tutorial</a>","released":"Mar 8, 2018","updated":"2024-10-25","icon":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WKdKYd0S2qocdcwrljXp4IitBnZzXyzUice4iMW9e4KiGS70MzFgl0HPrvRZU46cwBkuFJHQUgHxBZbYIkIcVOs","age":"Everyone"},"icon":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WKdKYd0S2qocdcwrljXp4IitBnZzXyzUice4iMW9e4KiGS70MzFgl0HPrvRZU46cwBkuFJHQUgHxBZbYIkIcVOs","cat":"Sports","rating":3.78,"ratings":116,"mentions":1,"users":1,"threads":1,"hn_points":0,"hn_comments":0,"submissions":0,"self_n":0,"hn_score":2.0,"first":1736614341,"last":1736614341,"show_hn":null,"n_lab":1,"pos_pct":0,"neg_pct":0,"mood":null,"quotes":[{"id":42667096,"k":"android:com.embarcadero.CamSextant","type":"comment","by":"exe34","time":1736614341,"text":"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.embarcadero.CamSextant&hl=en\n\nnot tried it","title":null,"story_id":42657208,"story_title":"Ships must practice celestial navigation","story_score":114,"comments":0,"w":1.0,"u":0,"s":"neu","self":false}],"slug":"camsextant"}